# Patterns to ignore when building packages.
*.tmpl
.DS_Store
# AppleDouble sidecars, which macOS writes when the chart is copied through a tar or a non-native filesystem.
# Helm reads every file under templates/, so one of these makes the whole install fail on a YAML parse error.
._*
.git/
.gitignore
*.swp
*.bak
*.orig
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
